abstract: "3,105 location points of urban plots (erven) in Paramaribo, Suriname, in 1885, based on the schematic town plan by A.J. Meyer (1885) placed on the 1916-17 survey map, with 1885 addresses, street names and plot functions; plus street lines (1885, 1916) and district boundaries (1885)."
